              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayakuhlala ezweni engalinika inceku yami uJakobe, ababehlala kulo oyihlo; bayohlala kulo, bona nabantwana babo nabantwana babantwana babo kuze kube phakade; inceku yami uDavida izakuba ngumbusi wabo kuze kube nininini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
